.#-----------------------------------------------------
.input|xwiki/2.1
.# Test that only the pipes of the text located in table cells are escaped, and not the pipes located inside some
.# syntax (links, images, macros, HTML tags, code spans), which would be kept in their content (see table31 for the
.# round trip). The separator of the wiki links and images located inside some emphasis is escaped, since a pipe
.# breaks the emphasis and the wiki link (splitting the cell), even if the backslash is then kept in their label.
.#-----------------------------------------------------
|=Element|=Content
|Text|a~|b ##c~|d##
|Link|[[label>>Space.Page]]
|Link label|[[a~|b>>Space.Page]]
|URL link|[[a~|b>>https://www.xwiki.org/]] [[https://www.xwiki.org/a~|b]]
|URL link emphasis|[[//a~|b//>>https://www.xwiki.org/]]
|Image|[[image:a.png]]
|URL image|[[image:https://www.xwiki.org/a.png||alt="a~|b"]]
|Macro|{{info title="a|b"/}} {{info}}c|d{{/info}}
|HTML|{{html}}<span title="a|b">c|d</span>{{/html}}
|HTML backticks|{{html}}<span title="`">|a</span><span title="`">b</span>{{/html}}
|Invalid HTML|{{html}}<!-- a -- b|c --> <span title={|}>d</span>{{/html}}
|Bold|**a~|b [[label>>Space.Page]] [[image:a.png]] [[image:b.png||alt="c"]]**
|Bold URL|**[[a~|b>>https://www.xwiki.org/]] [[image:https://www.xwiki.org/a.png||alt="a~|b"]]**
.#-----------------------------------------------------
.expect|markdown/1.2
.#-----------------------------------------------------
|      Element      | Content |
| ----------------- | --- |
|       Text        | a\|b `c|d` |
|       Link        | [[label|Space.Page]] |
|    Link label     | [[a&#124;b|Space.Page]] |
|     URL link      | [a\|b](https://www.xwiki.org/) <https://www.xwiki.org/a|b> |
| URL link emphasis | [_a\|b_](https://www.xwiki.org/) |
|       Image       | ![[a.png|a.png]] |
|     URL image     | ![a\|b](https://www.xwiki.org/a.png) |
|       Macro       | {{info title="a|b"/}} {{info}}c|d{{/info}} |
|       HTML        | <span title="a|b">c\|d</span> |
|  HTML backticks   | <span title="`">\|a</span><span title="`">b</span> |
|   Invalid HTML    | \<!-- a -- b\|c --> \<span title={\|}>d</span> |
|       Bold        | **a\|b [[label\|Space.Page]] ![[a.png]] ![[c\|b.png]]** |
|     Bold URL      | **[a\|b](https://www.xwiki.org/) ![a\|b](https://www.xwiki.org/a.png)** |
